(6430469, 954825, 70484, '<td valign="top">I''m glad we are able to see this little guy again. I sure do hope that people don''t lower their votes just because he''s shown up twice. I''m not. I think this is just as good as the first one. I love that he is staring at the water drop, that''s just too cool.</td>', 'I''m glad we are able to see this little guy again. I sure do hope that people don''t lower their votes just because he''s shown up twice. I''m not. I think this is just as good as the first one. I love that he is staring at the water drop, that''s just too cool.', '2011-06-01 08:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6430471, 954796, 70484, '<td valign="top">The expression is priceless!!</td>', 'The expression is priceless!!', '2011-06-01 08:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6430478, 953286, 70484, '<td valign="top">I love her eyes, they are beautifully captured. However, her hands are a bit awkward for me. Normally when someone rests their head in their hands, the arms aren''t crossed so the pinkies are closest to the camera instead of the thumbs. I don''t know, the hands just feel "off" to me. But I really like the focus on the eyes, they really pop.</td>', 'I love her eyes, they are beautifully captured. However, her hands are a bit awkward for me. Normally when someone rests their head in their hands, the arms aren''t crossed so the pinkies are closest to the camera instead of the thumbs. I don''t know, the hands just feel "off" to me. But I really like the focus on the eyes, they really pop.', '2011-06-01 08:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6430483, 954768, 70484, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of field here, but seeing the trash bin in the background kinda ruins it for me.</td>', 'I like the depth of field here, but seeing the trash bin in the background kinda ruins it for me.', '2011-06-01 08:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
