(6430496, 954114, 70484, '<td valign="top">She is absolutely gorgeous! I love the way you did the lighting. The only critique I may have is that I would like it if she was looking and reaching into the picture instead of out of the frame (so, more of the grass and dandelions in front of her instead of behind her). I hope that makes sense. But I love the picture anyway.</td>', 'She is absolutely gorgeous! I love the way you did the lighting. The only critique I may have is that I would like it if she was looking and reaching into the picture instead of out of the frame (so, more of the grass and dandelions in front of her instead of behind her). I hope that makes sense. But I love the picture anyway.', '2011-06-01 09:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6430502, 954680, 70484, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a colorful bird!!! I have never seen this or heard of it before. Thank you so much for sharing. Not only is the bird gorgeous, but you did an excellent job in capturing it.</td>', 'Wow, what a colorful bird!!! I have never seen this or heard of it before. Thank you so much for sharing. Not only is the bird gorgeous, but you did an excellent job in capturing it.', '2011-06-01 09:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
