(6430508, 954824, 70484, '<td valign="top">You have captured "Solitude" in a great way. I love the misty feel that he is walking into. However, the wood at the bottom of the picture is kinda distracting to me. I wonder how it would look cropped to just above the wood pieces. I think having just the person be the dark color of the picture might impress more of a feeling of solitude. Just an idea. But I still really like this photo.</td>', 'You have captured "Solitude" in a great way. I love the misty feel that he is walking into. However, the wood at the bottom of the picture is kinda distracting to me. I wonder how it would look cropped to just above the wood pieces. I think having just the person be the dark color of the picture might impress more of a feeling of solitude. Just an idea. But I still really like this photo.', '2011-06-01 09:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
