(6433285, 953891, 83313, '<td valign="top">A waterfall in Orgeon, must be a DrAchoo entry. If you had to move someplace without waterfalls and babbling brooks, would you experience withdrawal symptoms? Actually, I''m jealous that I don''t have things like this by me. Maybe I do and I just need to learn how to find them...</td>', 'A waterfall in Orgeon, must be a DrAchoo entry. If you had to move someplace without waterfalls and babbling brooks, would you experience withdrawal symptoms? Actually, I''m jealous that I don''t have things like this by me. Maybe I do and I just need to learn how to find them...', '2011-06-03 14:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
