(6434242, 954496, 76335, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully disorienting. I wonder if it would have been more or less effective in black and white...</td>', 'Wonderfully disorienting. I wonder if it would have been more or less effective in black and white...', '2011-06-04 23:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434244, 954243, 76335, '<td valign="top">I do like the head on point of view. Very in your face.</td>', 'I do like the head on point of view. Very in your face.', '2011-06-04 23:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434251, 954207, 76335, '<td valign="top">While not technically perfect, there is something enchanting about this.</td>', 'While not technically perfect, there is something enchanting about this.', '2011-06-04 23:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434307, 954825, 97225, '<td valign="top">And again - wonderful! I love how froggy is eye-balling that droplet. I''d love to see this at full size.</td>', 'And again - wonderful! I love how froggy is eye-balling that droplet. I''d love to see this at full size.', '2011-06-05 04:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434315, 953953, 100393, '<td valign="top">These grand landscapes don''t move me too often. This one does! Looks like one of Richard''s to me.</td>', 'These grand landscapes don''t move me too often. This one does! Looks like one of Richard''s to me.', '2011-06-05 04:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434425, 954614, 76335, '<td valign="top">Infrared? This does feel like a leap back in history -- in a magical sort of way.</td>', 'Infrared? This does feel like a leap back in history -- in a magical sort of way.', '2011-06-05 11:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434426, 953783, 76335, '<td valign="top">We lost some feet too, but it''s a good enough stop action shot that it''s easily overlooked.</td>', 'We lost some feet too, but it''s a good enough stop action shot that it''s easily overlooked.', '2011-06-05 11:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434429, 954246, 76335, '<td valign="top">I think the clouds need more highlights. They (or the sky) feel darker than the scene suggests.</td>', 'I think the clouds need more highlights. They (or the sky) feel darker than the scene suggests.', '2011-06-05 11:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434430, 954686, 76335, '<td valign="top">We can''t see her goreousness and we can''t see much of the view either. Title aside, it''s a fun (or funny) kind of shot.</td>', 'We can''t see her goreousness and we can''t see much of the view either. Title aside, it''s a fun (or funny) kind of shot.', '2011-06-05 11:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434431, 954269, 76335, '<td valign="top">Wonderful layers of color. I can''t help but wonder if more DOF would have helped this.</td>', 'Wonderful layers of color. I can''t help but wonder if more DOF would have helped this.', '2011-06-05 11:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434432, 954784, 76335, '<td valign="top">Sickening in a very pleasing sort of way.</td>', 'Sickening in a very pleasing sort of way.', '2011-06-05 11:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434434, 954540, 76335, '<td valign="top">A simply stated composition. All natural light, I presume. I wonder if a simple reflector (white board even) would have helped fill in some of the shadows under the fruit.</td>', 'A simply stated composition. All natural light, I presume. I wonder if a simple reflector (white board even) would have helped fill in some of the shadows under the fruit.', '2011-06-05 11:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434436, 954732, 76335, '<td valign="top">That spit curl of a leaf makes this wonderful.</td>', 'That spit curl of a leaf makes this wonderful.', '2011-06-05 11:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434438, 951451, 76335, '<td valign="top">Or intruder. Your two subjects complement each other to maximum effect here.</td>', 'Or intruder. Your two subjects complement each other to maximum effect here.', '2011-06-05 11:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434443, 954020, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love the crips colors, bold shapes, and glassy textures in this. And then there''s Elvis.</td>', 'I love the crips colors, bold shapes, and glassy textures in this. And then there''s Elvis.', '2011-06-05 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434444, 954467, 76335, '<td valign="top">Life is good.</td>', 'Life is good.', '2011-06-05 11:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434447, 949878, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like how the composition becomes gradually simpler, plainer, more featureless, as the eye moves from left to right. It''s sort of "antibalanced" in that sense, but it works.</td>', 'I like how the composition becomes gradually simpler, plainer, more featureless, as the eye moves from left to right. It''s sort of "antibalanced" in that sense, but it works.', '2011-06-05 11:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434448, 954714, 76335, '<td valign="top">Intersting the way the garden path gets swallowed up by the vegetation.</td>', 'Intersting the way the garden path gets swallowed up by the vegetation.', '2011-06-05 11:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434449, 954106, 76335, '<td valign="top">Very erotic.</td>', 'Very erotic.', '2011-06-05 11:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434450, 953692, 76335, '<td valign="top">There''s nothing like a contrail to finish off a great composition.</td>', 'There''s nothing like a contrail to finish off a great composition.', '2011-06-05 11:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434453, 954468, 76335, '<td valign="top">Either it''s really foggy or something went terribly wrong in postprocessing. I like the scene you captured.</td>', 'Either it''s really foggy or something went terribly wrong in postprocessing. I like the scene you captured.', '2011-06-05 11:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434455, 953172, 76335, '<td valign="top">Completely fascinating. I like photography that takes me to remote corners of the earth -- the jungle especially.</td>', 'Completely fascinating. I like photography that takes me to remote corners of the earth -- the jungle especially.', '2011-06-05 11:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434457, 952267, 76335, '<td valign="top">It''s funny that this photo came up for me right after voting on a picture of wild dogs in Africa. This is a terrific composition. What manners!</td>', 'It''s funny that this photo came up for me right after voting on a picture of wild dogs in Africa. This is a terrific composition. What manners!', '2011-06-05 11:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434459, 954548, 76335, '<td valign="top">The processing makes him feel like an apparition -- or a memory. Interesting.</td>', 'The processing makes him feel like an apparition -- or a memory. Interesting.', '2011-06-05 11:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434463, 953974, 76335, '<td valign="top">Picture of lighthouses are usually very up front -- monoliths standing up to the elements. So this is different. Your lighthouse is in the distance, its beacon barely visible. It feels delicate and looks like it could be swallowed up by sky and sea at any moment. A refreshing change.</td>', 'Picture of lighthouses are usually very up front -- monoliths standing up to the elements. So this is different. Your lighthouse is in the distance, its beacon barely visible. It feels delicate and looks like it could be swallowed up by sky and sea at any moment. A refreshing change.', '2011-06-05 11:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434468, 952737, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, though there might be too much headroom.</td>', 'Nicely done, though there might be too much headroom.', '2011-06-05 11:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434473, 954662, 76335, '<td valign="top">Intersting, though the foreground framing feels a bit clipped.</td>', 'Intersting, though the foreground framing feels a bit clipped.', '2011-06-05 11:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434475, 954190, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice point of view but too sharp.</td>', 'Nice point of view but too sharp.', '2011-06-05 11:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434476, 951353, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised it hasn''t been pulled for a rules violation. Creative and interesting nonetheless.</td>', 'I''m surprised it hasn''t been pulled for a rules violation. Creative and interesting nonetheless.', '2011-06-05 11:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434481, 954015, 76335, '<td valign="top">A terrific scene, but the sky feels overworked.</td>', 'A terrific scene, but the sky feels overworked.', '2011-06-05 11:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434483, 954787, 76335, '<td valign="top">And she''s striking quite the pose too.</td>', 'And she''s striking quite the pose too.', '2011-06-05 11:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434522, 953095, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely balanced.</td>', 'Nicely balanced.', '2011-06-05 12:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434523, 954471, 76335, '<td valign="top">Very animated. They appear to be dancing.</td>', 'Very animated. They appear to be dancing.', '2011-06-05 12:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434524, 954812, 76335, '<td valign="top">Blur + contrejour... Delightfully Spurgeonesque.</td>', 'Blur + contrejour... Delightfully Spurgeonesque.', '2011-06-05 12:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
