(6434527, 954621, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love how the creature''s legs carve out an asterisk. A wonderful composition.</td>', 'I love how the creature''s legs carve out an asterisk. A wonderful composition.', '2011-06-05 12:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
