(6434685, 954680, 39057, '<td valign="top">While on the surface this looks like a GREAT photo, when I look closer, I can tell it is a stuffed bird. I''ll forego why the actual bird looks fake but what sealed it for me is the little branch at the birds tail. I just know that you have the stuffed bird clipped to that branch. <br/> <br/>While I feel there is a place for fakes on the site, I feel you shouldn''t try to fake out the voter. I''m sorry but I can only give you a nine for this great nature shot. Had you going huh!</td>', 'While on the surface this looks like a GREAT photo, when I look closer, I can tell it is a stuffed bird. I''ll forego why the actual bird looks fake but what sealed it for me is the little branch at the birds tail. I just know that you have the stuffed bird clipped to that branch.  While I feel there is a place for fakes on the site, I feel you shouldn''t try to fake out the voter. I''m sorry but I can only give you a nine for this great nature shot. Had you going huh!', '2011-06-05 16:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6434686, 954431, 39057, '<td valign="top">Well..my eye went directly to the girl with the phone to her ear.. However, about one billionth of a second later by eye moved to another spot.</td>', 'Well..my eye went directly to the girl with the phone to her ear.. However, about one billionth of a second later by eye moved to another spot.', '2011-06-05 16:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
