(6434696, 953890, 39057, '<td valign="top">I liked it before I saw the title. Herpes is nothing to make fun of. It is a very bad sickness made worse by the fact that at times people don''t know they have it and then spread it around. Since you do not seem to care about people with herpes, I can only give this shot a 2. Ha, just joking. I''m a bio grad. I know what a herp is. Seven from me.</td>', 'I liked it before I saw the title. Herpes is nothing to make fun of. It is a very bad sickness made worse by the fact that at times people don''t know they have it and then spread it around. Since you do not seem to care about people with herpes, I can only give this shot a 2. Ha, just joking. I''m a bio grad. I know what a herp is. Seven from me.', '2011-06-05 16:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
