(6434706, 954496, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog visit big tribe in far away land, sees man in tall glass cave. Grog feels sorry for man. Does not know feel of grass under feet, or smell of fresh mastodon kill, or cold rock to sleep on, or smelly females always wanting Grog, or dung heap in back of cave....<br/> <br/>...er, how much animal pelts rent is?</td>', 'Grog visit big tribe in far away land, sees man in tall glass cave. Grog feels sorry for man. Does not know feel of grass under feet, or smell of fresh mastodon kill, or cold rock to sleep on, or smelly females always wanting Grog, or dung heap in back of cave.... ...er, how much animal pelts rent is?', '2011-06-05 17:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
