(6436829, 954689, 63218, '<td valign="top">This is jolly! My eye moves right around the row of flowers in a pleasant curve. The curled petal is so nice. Love the little hairs, detail I would never notice without a camera to help. Nice emerald green BG sets everything off.</td>', 'This is jolly! My eye moves right around the row of flowers in a pleasant curve. The curled petal is so nice. Love the little hairs, detail I would never notice without a camera to help. Nice emerald green BG sets everything off.', '2011-06-07 10:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436840, 954762, 63218, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a red flower. The red in this is nice. I zoomed in for a close view, seeing some noise but hardly any clipped red. I''m guessing this is in low light. The little bugs are leaving the scene, so IMO they aren''t adding much to the comp.  I''m practicing red flowers this summer, so this was a treat to look at. Thanks!</td>', 'Nice to see a red flower. The red in this is nice. I zoomed in for a close view, seeing some noise but hardly any clipped red. I''m guessing this is in low light. The little bugs are leaving the scene, so IMO they aren''t adding much to the comp.  I''m practicing red flowers this summer, so this was a treat to look at. Thanks!', '2011-06-07 11:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6436852, 951451, 63218, '<td valign="top">The bright fresh clean colors are very attractive here &amp; IMO the crop is excellent, it turn me into the visitor. The bug is almost shockingly out of place against that pristine white, but such an interesting bug. Sweet shot.</td>', 'The bright fresh clean colors are very attractive here & IMO the crop is excellent, it turn me into the visitor. The bug is almost shockingly out of place against that pristine white, but such an interesting bug. Sweet shot.', '2011-06-07 11:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
