(6437319, 950372, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.<br/> <br/>Positives: A very interesting image. Makes me want to know more about the back story. Despite the very heavy grain, this still works - and perhaps because of it. It adds a lot of ambiguity and imprecision to the image. It encourages the imagination.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: the grain ;-) I like it but others won''t.<br/> <br/>Overall: Fascinating.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. Positives: A very interesting image. Makes me want to know more about the back story. Despite the very heavy grain, this still works - and perhaps because of it. It adds a lot of ambiguity and imprecision to the image. It encourages the imagination. Critical stuff: the grain ;-) I like it but others won''t. Overall: Fascinating.', '2011-06-07 18:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437321, 954557, 11769, '<td valign="top">How darling</td>', 'How darling', '2011-06-07 18:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
