(6437323, 954812, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.<br/> <br/>Positives: I absolutely love this. The light, the tones, the abstracted figure, the footprints.... All marvellous.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nope.<br/> <br/>Overall: my favourite in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. Positives: I absolutely love this. The light, the tones, the abstracted figure, the footprints.... All marvellous. Critical stuff: Nope. Overall: my favourite in the challenge.', '2011-06-07 18:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437325, 954812, 11769, '<td valign="top">Like shes running out of your life. Time passes so fast, what was here only a moment ago is now lost forever.</td>', 'Like shes running out of your life. Time passes so fast, what was here only a moment ago is now lost forever.', '2011-06-07 18:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437327, 954456, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.<br/> <br/>Positives: I love how you''ve pushed those colours. The shuddering trail of lights fascinates.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Not the most interesting scene (but I love what you''ve done with it).<br/> <br/>Overall: great vision.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. Positives: I love how you''ve pushed those colours. The shuddering trail of lights fascinates. Critical stuff: Not the most interesting scene (but I love what you''ve done with it). Overall: great vision.', '2011-06-07 18:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
