(6437333, 954251, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.<br/> <br/>Positives: This is a bold and magnificent portrait. Bold pose, bold light, bold colour, bold processing, bold subject. Some will hate the rope but I love it.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Some will hate the rope!<br/> <br/>Overall: pushes the boundaries and challenges preconceptions. Great stuff.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. Positives: This is a bold and magnificent portrait. Bold pose, bold light, bold colour, bold processing, bold subject. Some will hate the rope but I love it. Critical stuff: Some will hate the rope! Overall: pushes the boundaries and challenges preconceptions. Great stuff.', '2011-06-07 19:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
