(6437714, 952502, 111519, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the compliments, pamb, Jutilda, and paulbtlw.  And thanks for the input, dianapf1.<br/> <br/>Vintage 1950''s/Norman Rockwell is what I was going for with this processing, which is really outside my normal "thing" so it was a fun educational stretch into a new area.<br/> <br/>Thanks, paulbtlw, for taking the extra time to look for the out-of-the-ordinary/unconventional.  I try to do the same thing when I vote/critique as my eye likes to find the things that haven''t been seen before or not seen in the same way.  I''m glad this photo worked for you!</td>', 'Thanks for the compliments, pamb, Jutilda, and paulbtlw.  And thanks for the input, dianapf1. Vintage 1950''s/Norman Rockwell is what I was going for with this processing, which is really outside my normal "thing" so it was a fun educational stretch into a new area. Thanks, paulbtlw, for taking the extra time to look for the out-of-the-ordinary/unconventional.  I try to do the same thing when I vote/critique as my eye likes to find the things that haven''t been seen before or not seen in the same way.  I''m glad this photo worked for you!', '2011-06-08 01:11:06.000000', NULL, 0),
