(6438171, 954600, 44877, '<td valign="top">Well... it definitely had appeal for a whole bunch of people, which is comforting. It always galls me that you can have so many 5''s and then end up in the 4''s. The  people who gave you a 1,2,3, and 4 are clearly idiots. Seriously. <br/> <br/>Love the commenters'' score!! Me, I like this image. It is incredibly zen, leads the eye, is technically excellent. And what Deb said - I get calm just looking at it.</td>', 'Well... it definitely had appeal for a whole bunch of people, which is comforting. It always galls me that you can have so many 5''s and then end up in the 4''s. The  people who gave you a 1,2,3, and 4 are clearly idiots. Seriously.  Love the commenters'' score!! Me, I like this image. It is incredibly zen, leads the eye, is technically excellent. And what Deb said - I get calm just looking at it.', '2011-06-08 09:14:16.000000', NULL, 0),
