(6438204, 951937, 10785, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> LOL!   I see woman/man here... He''s got his hand on her bottom and her hand is clinched, fingers into almost a fist...  <br/> <br/>Body Language.   *sigh*  <br/>(not voting) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Nice observation... There''s a definite gap between the two of them. He''s leaning in to kiss her but still keeping his distance and she''s kind of pushing him away.</td>', 'Originally posted by LydiaToo: LOL!   I see woman/man here... He''s got his hand on her bottom and her hand is clinched, fingers into almost a fist...   Body Language.   *sigh*  (not voting)   Nice observation... There''s a definite gap between the two of them. He''s leaning in to kiss her but still keeping his distance and she''s kind of pushing him away.', '2011-06-08 09:39:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438219, 954681, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love your title.  Your timing was good for capturing this pose.  I love her outfit too.  I''m not sure if you can do it with your camera, but for an indoor lighting shot, I''d try and change the F-stop number.  Get it as low as possible (use the f 4.5).  This means the aperature is bigger, and more light will get in.  More light means you can use a faster shutter speed and that starts to cut down on the possibility of blurring the shot.<br/> <br/>You have a great eye for these types of moments. I can''t wait to see more of your work :)</td>', 'I love your title.  Your timing was good for capturing this pose.  I love her outfit too.  I''m not sure if you can do it with your camera, but for an indoor lighting shot, I''d try and change the F-stop number.  Get it as low as possible (use the f 4.5).  This means the aperature is bigger, and more light will get in.  More light means you can use a faster shutter speed and that starts to cut down on the possibility of blurring the shot. You have a great eye for these types of moments. I can''t wait to see more of your work :)', '2011-06-08 09:48:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438221, 954564, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. You got a nice high average score for this site. 5.6889 to me means people liked it but it still needed something. I really liked the composition, the lighting is spectacular, the pigeon is an added bonus and really, the horizon seems just above center, though not quite conforming to the rule of thirds. I think the saturation is decent. Possibly a little less could have worked better. The contrast is a little heavy in my opinion.<br/> <br/>What could have made it better? Well a longer shutter speed to smooth out the water of course. Compare this photo to your personal best photo and notice the difference...<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=411886" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/569/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_411886.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/569/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_411886.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/569/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_411886.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Your PB has the same saturation but is softer due to a longer exposure. The water is like glass and shows off the reflection well. Hope my comments helped.</td>', 'I like this photo. You got a nice high average score for this site. 5.6889 to me means people liked it but it still needed something. I really liked the composition, the lighting is spectacular, the pigeon is an added bonus and really, the horizon seems just above center, though not quite conforming to the rule of thirds. I think the saturation is decent. Possibly a little less could have worked better. The contrast is a little heavy in my opinion. What could have made it better? Well a longer shutter speed to smooth out the water of course. Compare this photo to your personal best photo and notice the difference...   Your PB has the same saturation but is softer due to a longer exposure. The water is like glass and shows off the reflection well. Hope my comments helped.', '2011-06-08 09:49:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438240, 954564, 119747, '<td valign="top">I think, like EL-ROI said, the water would be so much better smooth but obviously sometimes that''s not possible. I also think the foreground and the pier are lacking some detail and could maybe use HDR. Saying that though its a photo you should be proud of.</td>', 'I think, like EL-ROI said, the water would be so much better smooth but obviously sometimes that''s not possible. I also think the foreground and the pier are lacking some detail and could maybe use HDR. Saying that though its a photo you should be proud of.', '2011-06-08 10:02:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438241, 954541, 119747, '<td valign="top">I like this but I think she looks very awkwardly positioned and it''s not natural. The smoke is nice but I think a different pov/crop would improve it.</td>', 'I like this but I think she looks very awkwardly positioned and it''s not natural. The smoke is nice but I think a different pov/crop would improve it.', '2011-06-08 10:04:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438245, 954563, 42256, '<td valign="top">very underrated imho! Beautiful landscape Sara!</td>', 'very underrated imho! Beautiful landscape Sara!', '2011-06-08 10:09:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438253, 954564, 114233, '<td valign="top">Something else that might have got a point or two knocked off by some voters is that it seems to be oversharpened. There is a halo around the bird, the pier and the top of the lighthouse. It also undoubtedly accentuates the ripples in the water and as <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=10785" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">EL-ROI</a> said smoother water would have worked better to add to the smoothness and calmness of the sunset. Hope that helps a bit more...</td>', 'Something else that might have got a point or two knocked off by some voters is that it seems to be oversharpened. There is a halo around the bird, the pier and the top of the lighthouse. It also undoubtedly accentuates the ripples in the water and as  EL-ROI said smoother water would have worked better to add to the smoothness and calmness of the sunset. Hope that helps a bit more...', '2011-06-08 10:33:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438259, 953953, 72894, '<td valign="top">Fantastic ! !  The only, and I mean, ONLY thing that I would want to change (seriously, nothing really) would be to try a narrow crop just to see if it give ''height'' to the image.  Again, Fantastic !</td>', 'Fantastic ! !  The only, and I mean, ONLY thing that I would want to change (seriously, nothing really) would be to try a narrow crop just to see if it give ''height'' to the image.  Again, Fantastic !', '2011-06-08 10:44:48.000000', NULL, 0),
