(6438324, 954424, 48928, '<td valign="top">Sometimes I really do not understand DPC... this is very underrated to me... and you only received 4 comments during voting?<br/>Different challenge perhaps and I think this would have scored much higher.</td>', 'Sometimes I really do not understand DPC... this is very underrated to me... and you only received 4 comments during voting?Different challenge perhaps and I think this would have scored much higher.', '2011-06-08 11:22:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438327, 954443, 48928, '<td valign="top">Coming back to add to favorites, very underrated shot!</td>', 'Coming back to add to favorites, very underrated shot!', '2011-06-08 11:23:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438333, 954103, 48928, '<td valign="top">Underrated :)  Great shot!</td>', 'Underrated :)  Great shot!', '2011-06-08 11:25:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438351, 954259, 83313, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 6. Didn''t blow me away, but I thought it an interesting view and fit the title nicely. It almost got a Grog comment. There was an idea forming in my head, but I couldn''t quite get something usable out of that idea.</td>', 'I gave it a 6. Didn''t blow me away, but I thought it an interesting view and fit the title nicely. It almost got a Grog comment. There was an idea forming in my head, but I couldn''t quite get something usable out of that idea.', '2011-06-08 11:31:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438355, 953957, 38162, '<td valign="top">hardly glory when this thing dropped nuclear bombs on civilian populations.  wish they all were "static".   sorry but its time to stop glorifying war.</td>', 'hardly glory when this thing dropped nuclear bombs on civilian populations.  wish they all were "static".   sorry but its time to stop glorifying war.', '2011-06-08 11:33:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438359, 954664, 50641, '<td valign="top">This is very, very good.  it''s likely that narrowminded kneejerkers were knocking you down a few points for ''blown out areas'', when of course, that''s part of the magic here.  I love the mood and the processing and the expression.  Personally would have wished for a bit more space but that''s probably only because I''m not generally a fan of fashion model shots - which is what this invokes.  Please keep going with your gut - keep it artistic and interesting and don''t dumb it down for a score.</td>', 'This is very, very good.  it''s likely that narrowminded kneejerkers were knocking you down a few points for ''blown out areas'', when of course, that''s part of the magic here.  I love the mood and the processing and the expression.  Personally would have wished for a bit more space but that''s probably only because I''m not generally a fan of fashion model shots - which is what this invokes.  Please keep going with your gut - keep it artistic and interesting and don''t dumb it down for a score.', '2011-06-08 11:35:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438362, 954564, 52336, '<td valign="top">I think you relied too much on eye-popping colour.  (Eye-popping isn''t always good, and often looks artificial.)  Consider this photo without the orange cast: a fairly straightforward shot of a not-too-interesting subject.  Nothing really connects here with the average viewer to make it stand out as an exceptional photograph, and so I think the score reflects that.</td>', 'I think you relied too much on eye-popping colour.  (Eye-popping isn''t always good, and often looks artificial.)  Consider this photo without the orange cast: a fairly straightforward shot of a not-too-interesting subject.  Nothing really connects here with the average viewer to make it stand out as an exceptional photograph, and so I think the score reflects that.', '2011-06-08 11:37:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438375, 953117, 50641, '<td valign="top">This is nice -  you gotta work harder on the ''hate it'' part ;-)  Something''s not working for me with the orientation or composition - I want to go into the tunnel on the right and I can''t.  But, you''ve got lovely colors, well controlled highlights (in context), and the swiss cheese effect is kinda cool.  For me, the best abstracts are subliminally suggestive of something representational, this allows a toehold of a sort.</td>', 'This is nice -  you gotta work harder on the ''hate it'' part ;-)  Something''s not working for me with the orientation or composition - I want to go into the tunnel on the right and I can''t.  But, you''ve got lovely colors, well controlled highlights (in context), and the swiss cheese effect is kinda cool.  For me, the best abstracts are subliminally suggestive of something representational, this allows a toehold of a sort.', '2011-06-08 11:44:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438387, 954499, 86447, '<td valign="top">I am SO SURPRISED that this did not score higher.    It''s so lovely.</td>', 'I am SO SURPRISED that this did not score higher.    It''s so lovely.', '2011-06-08 11:49:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438391, 954564, 11518, '<td valign="top">Hope this helps, since you asked: over-sharpening artifacts, haloing around the pier and lighthouse, harsh light, vertical crop might not have been the best choice...</td>', 'Hope this helps, since you asked: over-sharpening artifacts, haloing around the pier and lighthouse, harsh light, vertical crop might not have been the best choice...', '2011-06-08 11:51:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438418, 953953, 126371, '<td valign="top">Amazing image. I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I''ll give this a 10 now! Linc commented about possibly cropping a tad (I won''t restate it here) and I did wonder that myself. IMO, perhaps the stream at the bottom is a bit distracting... CONGRATS on the blue!</td>', 'Amazing image. I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I''ll give this a 10 now! Linc commented about possibly cropping a tad (I won''t restate it here) and I did wonder that myself. IMO, perhaps the stream at the bottom is a bit distracting... CONGRATS on the blue!', '2011-06-08 12:06:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438425, 954825, 38032, '<td valign="top">3 scores of 1  golly some people are jealous I guess.<br/>This is quite an amazing image for sure.  Congrats.</td>', '3 scores of 1  golly some people are jealous I guess.This is quite an amazing image for sure.  Congrats.', '2011-06-08 12:09:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438426, 954825, 90495, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-06-08 22:09:51.</i></td>', 'Nice shot.', '2011-06-08 12:11:40.000000', '2011-06-08 23:09:51.000000', 0),
(6438427, 954065, 57447, '<td valign="top">Good for you.  Your research paid off!</td>', 'Good for you.  Your research paid off!', '2011-06-08 12:11:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438443, 954446, 50641, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the compliment, P, I''m flattered -  I''d be thrilled if I made this image.  Love the colors - looks like a very adept inversion.</td>', 'Thanks for the compliment, P, I''m flattered -  I''d be thrilled if I made this image.  Love the colors - looks like a very adept inversion.', '2011-06-08 12:16:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438446, 954728, 50641, '<td valign="top">wonderful puzzle!</td>', 'wonderful puzzle!', '2011-06-08 12:16:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438453, 953765, 30214, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, Valeriy! The foreground reflection, the skater, the booth, the water, the mountains... So many layers, and all interesting</td>', 'Lovely shot, Valeriy! The foreground reflection, the skater, the booth, the water, the mountains... So many layers, and all interesting', '2011-06-08 12:20:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438491, 954564, 65319, '<td valign="top">I love to take photos like this one with strong color and silhouettes. I like the seagull as foreground interest. The composition may have benefitted from taking the photo earlier when the sun is behind the lighthouse and perhaps peaking through the top window to get some interesting rays. The blue could be processed to clear out the muddy gray which appears a bit heavy. Overall, this scene is pretty but not polished enough in either processing or composition to achieve more impact. My two cents...;-)</td>', 'I love to take photos like this one with strong color and silhouettes. I like the seagull as foreground interest. The composition may have benefitted from taking the photo earlier when the sun is behind the lighthouse and perhaps peaking through the top window to get some interesting rays. The blue could be processed to clear out the muddy gray which appears a bit heavy. Overall, this scene is pretty but not polished enough in either processing or composition to achieve more impact. My two cents...;-)', '2011-06-08 12:34:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438496, 954728, 96751, '<td valign="top">Congrats on making the gallery.  Thought provoking image.</td>', 'Congrats on making the gallery.  Thought provoking image.', '2011-06-08 12:36:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438498, 951946, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is a sumptuous richness that invites the eye.</td>', 'There is a sumptuous richness that invites the eye.', '2011-06-08 12:37:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438505, 954564, 103142, '<td valign="top">I gave it an 8 (probably because I love the bird -- it makes the photo), but there definitely is haloing, and usually I''ll take a point off for that. The water does look oversharpened.</td>', 'I gave it an 8 (probably because I love the bird -- it makes the photo), but there definitely is haloing, and usually I''ll take a point off for that. The water does look oversharpened.', '2011-06-08 12:41:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438510, 954794, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous to see you again!  Love this image.</td>', 'Fabulous to see you again!  Love this image.', '2011-06-08 12:43:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438512, 954664, 103142, '<td valign="top">I thought it was beautifully done, but for some reason it just didn''t wow me. The processing, the tones, everything is very well done, but the expression on the face just seems awkward. It''s not that it seems uncomfortable, or forced, or anything like that. It''s just doesn''t seem to fit the photo. It was a 6 from me. Not that I thought it at the time, but it probably would have been an 8 with a better expression. The shot is beautiful -- but didn''t connect.</td>', 'I thought it was beautifully done, but for some reason it just didn''t wow me. The processing, the tones, everything is very well done, but the expression on the face just seems awkward. It''s not that it seems uncomfortable, or forced, or anything like that. It''s just doesn''t seem to fit the photo. It was a 6 from me. Not that I thought it at the time, but it probably would have been an 8 with a better expression. The shot is beautiful -- but didn''t connect.', '2011-06-08 12:44:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438513, 952600, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is an unusual, photojournalistic, Bigfoot-spotting type quality to this image.  Love it.</td>', 'There is an unusual, photojournalistic, Bigfoot-spotting type quality to this image.  Love it.', '2011-06-08 12:45:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438516, 954443, 96751, '<td valign="top">Worthy of contemplation.  Nice to see your work again.</td>', 'Worthy of contemplation.  Nice to see your work again.', '2011-06-08 12:47:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438518, 954541, 103142, '<td valign="top">The pose seemed very awkward -- but it could have worked: awkward can be extremely interesting. I think the problem is that her expression seems lifeless. The lighting, the smoke, all the rest is very nicely done. It just needed a little life to it. (6, btw)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-06-08 11:48:07.</i></td>', 'The pose seemed very awkward -- but it could have worked: awkward can be extremely interesting. I think the problem is that her expression seems lifeless. The lighting, the smoke, all the rest is very nicely done. It just needed a little life to it. (6, btw)', '2011-06-08 12:47:58.000000', '2011-06-08 12:48:07.000000', 0),
(6438519, 954065, 112972, '<td valign="top">Great work, Alex!  Beautiful shot.  I love the leading lines in this image.  Congrats!</td>', 'Great work, Alex!  Beautiful shot.  I love the leading lines in this image.  Congrats!', '2011-06-08 12:48:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438520, 954698, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''ve heard about you :-)  Glad you''re back - I''mlooking forward to more great stuff from you.</td>', 'I''ve heard about you :-)  Glad you''re back - I''mlooking forward to more great stuff from you.', '2011-06-08 12:49:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438533, 954541, 19944, '<td valign="top">To me, her pose seems forced.  She doesn''t look comfortable at all.  That being said, I like the smoke and the lighting.<br/> <br/>And her stockings are wrinkled.</td>', 'To me, her pose seems forced.  She doesn''t look comfortable at all.  That being said, I like the smoke and the lighting. And her stockings are wrinkled.', '2011-06-08 13:04:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438535, 953117, 19944, '<td valign="top">You can put me in the ''love it'' category, but I gan certainly see how someone could hate it, too.  I''m surprised you got so many "meh" votes.</td>', 'You can put me in the ''love it'' category, but I gan certainly see how someone could hate it, too.  I''m surprised you got so many "meh" votes.', '2011-06-08 13:06:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438538, 954664, 19944, '<td valign="top">I think this is absolutely beautiful. I love the softness of it and the bright areas on the right add something special.</td>', 'I think this is absolutely beautiful. I love the softness of it and the bright areas on the right add something special.', '2011-06-08 13:07:43.000000', NULL, 0),
