(6438793, 954262, 68947, '<td valign="top">OMG...just looked to see that we ARE "neighbours" in this challenge!  I didn''t vote in this one but, I did view all of the shots and had a sneaking suspicion that this one might have been yours. :)  It''s lovely! :)</td>', 'OMG...just looked to see that we ARE "neighbours" in this challenge!  I didn''t vote in this one but, I did view all of the shots and had a sneaking suspicion that this one might have been yours. :)  It''s lovely! :)', '2011-06-08 16:03:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438799, 950559, 129267, '<td valign="top">Lighting is good and the textures are nice. It feels a little bit less than sharp to me, I probably would have given it a 5-6. I''m not a big fan of the black background being used to isolate the flower, it feels unnatural and makes the mood borderline dark.</td>', 'Lighting is good and the textures are nice. It feels a little bit less than sharp to me, I probably would have given it a 5-6. I''m not a big fan of the black background being used to isolate the flower, it feels unnatural and makes the mood borderline dark.', '2011-06-08 16:15:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438801, 954664, 129267, '<td valign="top">I love this shot!<br/> <br/>I didn''t get a chance to vote, but I would have given this an 8. Lighting is spot on, great model, and snapped at just the right moment. It really captures motion and energy. <br/> <br/>on the negatives, it seems a bit on the dark side on a few details (clothing), and could use just a hair more separation from the background (upper left- hair &amp; dark area merge a bit)</td>', 'I love this shot! I didn''t get a chance to vote, but I would have given this an 8. Lighting is spot on, great model, and snapped at just the right moment. It really captures motion and energy.  on the negatives, it seems a bit on the dark side on a few details (clothing), and could use just a hair more separation from the background (upper left- hair & dark area merge a bit)', '2011-06-08 16:21:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438810, 954794, 62357, '<td valign="top">Ah but of course this was yours.  I didn''t end up voting, but took a quick look and this jumped off the page at me.  Not surprised it''s yours really.  Nice to see you around.</td>', 'Ah but of course this was yours.  I didn''t end up voting, but took a quick look and this jumped off the page at me.  Not surprised it''s yours really.  Nice to see you around.', '2011-06-08 16:30:02.000000', NULL, 0),
