(6438892, 953131, 11854, '<td valign="top">And not a single comment! Ouch! I think the problem is simply it''s a FS and people expect WOW. There''s no WOW here. It''s a simple picture, well taken, that would have done better in a themed type challenge (such as body parts for instance). It''s just to quiet for a FS.</td>', 'And not a single comment! Ouch! I think the problem is simply it''s a FS and people expect WOW. There''s no WOW here. It''s a simple picture, well taken, that would have done better in a themed type challenge (such as body parts for instance). It''s just to quiet for a FS.', '2011-06-08 17:01:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438893, 951348, 61552, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kenskid:</b></div><hr/><i> That''s unreal...where were you when you shot this ? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I was sitting in the back left seat of a UH60 Blackhawk helicopter.  The Army National Guard at the Fresno airport was giving us controllers rides around the local area.  Got a few great shots of the control tower, too.</td>', 'Originally posted by kenskid: That''s unreal...where were you when you shot this ?   I was sitting in the back left seat of a UH60 Blackhawk helicopter.  The Army National Guard at the Fresno airport was giving us controllers rides around the local area.  Got a few great shots of the control tower, too.', '2011-06-08 17:01:16.000000', NULL, 0),
