(6439028, 954690, 101702, '<td valign="top">I thought this might be yours until I realised it wasn''t your daughter!! Decided it must have been someone elses... :-) I gave this one a five, mostly because she is running away from shot rather than into it, so there was little connection with the viewer. Not a bad effort though, clearly you panned with the runner... I agree with your comment about a sharper face helping. Not much you can do about that though except take 1000 shots and hope 1 nails it.</td>', 'I thought this might be yours until I realised it wasn''t your daughter!! Decided it must have been someone elses... :-) I gave this one a five, mostly because she is running away from shot rather than into it, so there was little connection with the viewer. Not a bad effort though, clearly you panned with the runner... I agree with your comment about a sharper face helping. Not much you can do about that though except take 1000 shots and hope 1 nails it.', '2011-06-08 18:44:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6439030, 951622, 68956, '<td valign="top">I love it!</td>', 'I love it!', '2011-06-08 18:45:33.000000', NULL, 0),
