(6439293, 954829, 42135, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 6 vote .. I found it a bit of an awkward composition .. I enjoyed the photo as a snapshot but not something I''d hang on my wall. The whites of the falls (though well done) were (for me) too overpowering in the overall shot. The rocks look too heavy against the whites of the falls .. some dodge and burn of the rocks might have been helpful in this shot to balance it out. Hope this helps :)</td>', 'I gave you a 6 vote .. I found it a bit of an awkward composition .. I enjoyed the photo as a snapshot but not something I''d hang on my wall. The whites of the falls (though well done) were (for me) too overpowering in the overall shot. The rocks look too heavy against the whites of the falls .. some dodge and burn of the rocks might have been helpful in this shot to balance it out. Hope this helps :)', '2011-06-09 01:44:11.000000', NULL, 0),
