(6439394, 954692, 117474, '<td valign="top">Fascinating image. I think I just gave it a quick 6. Would have given it more if I had considered it longer. <br/>I think the left hand side of the image is a bit distracting (from very dark to very bright) and if I was taking the shot I''d''ve probably hit it with a bit multiple exposures to get some detail there. Still, maybe the contrast between the colour and black and white complements the depth of the image. <br/>It''s really nice. I think it should have seen the higher side of 5.5</td>', 'Fascinating image. I think I just gave it a quick 6. Would have given it more if I had considered it longer. I think the left hand side of the image is a bit distracting (from very dark to very bright) and if I was taking the shot I''d''ve probably hit it with a bit multiple exposures to get some detail there. Still, maybe the contrast between the colour and black and white complements the depth of the image. It''s really nice. I think it should have seen the higher side of 5.5', '2011-06-09 07:47:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6439409, 953117, 117474, '<td valign="top">Haha. Better luck next time! :)<br/>Unknown to myself the average of all my entries has just the thing you''re looking for! <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=956178" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/117474/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_956178.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/117474/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_956178.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/117474/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_956178.png"/></a> <br/></td>', 'Haha. Better luck next time! :)Unknown to myself the average of all my entries has just the thing you''re looking for!  ', '2011-06-09 08:28:33.000000', NULL, 0),
