(6439438, 954585, 93283, '<td valign="top">Jane... Fantastic shot!!! Voted this one an 8 and was actually planning to come back and comment but ran out of time. Congrats on the personal best and its so great to see the VC members growing as photogs... What really makes this shot is that the dog is looking at you, and he/she is in a moment of thought... Great capture!</td>', 'Jane... Fantastic shot!!! Voted this one an 8 and was actually planning to come back and comment but ran out of time. Congrats on the personal best and its so great to see the VC members growing as photogs... What really makes this shot is that the dog is looking at you, and he/she is in a moment of thought... Great capture!', '2011-06-09 10:12:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6439467, 954065, 69008, '<td valign="top">Well done!  The choice of lens angle and point of view combined to make the most of the ramp or extension of the long dock, where it goes out into the sky.  With the star trails it makes a grabber of an image.  Your attention to all the elements in this shot shows in the result, and the ribbon.  <br/>The D7000 is an impressive camera too. Congrats on the ribbon, and on the new hardware. <br/>If you are just out shooting JPG, try a night shot using "incandescent" or "Tungsten" white balance, and the sky will be a lovely blue.  When shooting RAW, it can be done in processing.  The orange in this one is great for the effect that it''s at the "End of the World".</td>', 'Well done!  The choice of lens angle and point of view combined to make the most of the ramp or extension of the long dock, where it goes out into the sky.  With the star trails it makes a grabber of an image.  Your attention to all the elements in this shot shows in the result, and the ribbon.  The D7000 is an impressive camera too. Congrats on the ribbon, and on the new hardware. If you are just out shooting JPG, try a night shot using "incandescent" or "Tungsten" white balance, and the sky will be a lovely blue.  When shooting RAW, it can be done in processing.  The orange in this one is great for the effect that it''s at the "End of the World".', '2011-06-09 11:41:55.000000', NULL, 0),
