(6448903, 953957, 62187, '<td valign="top">Yes, the days of this plane are over and I''m sure many of the people who fought during that time hated it at the time but for the most part we have moved on and are mostly friendly with each other. But...they brought it to us, our civilian population AND, they were warned...what did they expect? In my opinion, that comment ''below'' had no place here, especially in ''public''. It said nothing of your photographic work. It is a very artistic look and feel to it. The crop is right on and it has a historic place in our DPC files. ''Somber'' - very well put and I''m wondering if it was read prior to the comment....GEEZ!</td>', 'Yes, the days of this plane are over and I''m sure many of the people who fought during that time hated it at the time but for the most part we have moved on and are mostly friendly with each other. But...they brought it to us, our civilian population AND, they were warned...what did they expect? In my opinion, that comment ''below'' had no place here, especially in ''public''. It said nothing of your photographic work. It is a very artistic look and feel to it. The crop is right on and it has a historic place in our DPC files. ''Somber'' - very well put and I''m wondering if it was read prior to the comment....GEEZ!', '2011-06-20 23:29:11.000000', NULL, 0),
